00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:48,000
Kickboxer is a 1989 American martial arts film directed by
David Worth and starring Jean-Claude Van Damme.

4
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Former world kickboxing champion Dennis Alexio is also featured.

5
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:36,000
The plot revolves around Kurt Sloane (Van Damme) seeking revenge on the fearsome kickboxing
champion Tong Po (Michel Qissi) who paralyzed his brother Eric Sloane (Dennis Alexio).

6
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:30,000
The film is regarded as the first movie to bring Muay Thai
(Thai kickboxing) to a global audience.

7
01:02:18,000 --> 01:02:24,000
Produced by Kings Road Entertainment and released by The Cannon Group, Inc.

8
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:18,000
on September 8, 1989, it grossed $50 million on a budget of $2.7 million.

9
01:20:06,000 --> 01:20:12,000
It spawned several sequels.
